## Summary: exp002 (Retry) — Prepared and Ready

**What**: Retry exp002 — Baseline (Stage 1) with `lam=10.0` (amp loss weight increased from 1.0 to 10.0)

**Why**: exp001 showed f0 CE (~2.7) dominated 82% of total loss, leaving amp under-trained (amp_corr = 0.61). Raising λ to 10.0 will boost amp loss contribution to ~6.0 vs f0's ~2.7, giving amp stronger gradient signal.

**What changed vs exp001**: Only `stage1.lam: 10.0` (was 1.0). All other hyperparameters identical.

